:01:53.16,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi zamanda biraz geri gidiyoruz. Zoro,  Perona'yla birlikte beklenmedik bir biçimde mahsur kaldı.Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.30,0:01:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu...Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.54,0:02:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mezar, ha?Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.11,0:02:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim yapmış olabilir ki?Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.47,0:02:05.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük bir ağaçtan tek parça olarak kesilmiş.Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Etkileyici bir işçilik.Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.05,0:02:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine de çok büyük.Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.59,0:02:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hızlı!Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.14,0:02:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Geri püskürttü!Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.95,0:02:44.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Bak!Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.33,0:03:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi piçler...Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.45,0:03:20.48,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası Namakura Adasına bağlı, Sefalet Ülkesi, HarahetterniaDialogue: 50,0:03:20.98,0:03:24.99,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Yerel halk Brook'u,  Şeytan Kral Satan'la karıştırdı.Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.03,0:03:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne keyifli bir sabah.Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.61,0:03:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun Kol Kabilesi!Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.98,0:03:45.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.12,0:03:54.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır!Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.95,0:03:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurtarın beni!Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.99,0:04:00.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi pataklamamızı mı istiyorsunuz, kahrolası pislikler?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.59,0:04:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kızı geri verin!Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.69,0:04:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizi rahat bırakın artık, şerefsizler!Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.90,0:04:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızımı geri verin!Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.70,0:04:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepinizi Cehennem'e göndereceğiz!Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.94,0:04:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nee?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.14,0:04:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İmdat!Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.64,0:04:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurtarın beni!Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.58,0:04:23.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey, o kadın götürülüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.21,0:04:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.31,0:04:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi onlara lanetinizi gösterin!Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.22,0:04:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalvarırız!Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.42,0:04:31.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, onu kurtarmalıyız!Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.72,0:04:34.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Satan-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.33,0:04:39.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Genç bayan...Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.03,0:04:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Satan-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.23,0:04:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalvarırız!Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.03,0:04:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlara kutsal adaleti uygulayın!Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.50,0:04:48.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yalvarırız! – Yalvarırız!Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.57,0:04:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu insanlar başkalarına çok güveniyor.Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.81,0:04:59.88,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama kurban o genç bayan!Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanlış bir şey yapmadı.Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.45,0:05:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.55,0:05:07.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Misafirperverliğinize ve  külotlarınıza karşı borcumu ödemeliyim.Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.93,0:05:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evet! – Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.33,0:05:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Satan! – Satan!Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.36,0:05:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Satan! Satan! – Satan! Satan!Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.94,0:05:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Satan! Satan! – Satan! Satan!Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.61,0:05:23.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san. Arkadaşlar.Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.87,0:05:29.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu anda, "Satan-sama" diye çağırılırken, etrafım bir sürü külotla çevrildi.Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.51,0:05:32.25,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kusura bakmayın, ama biraz daha beklemek zorundasınız.Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.25,0:05:36.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Malum borcu ödemezsem, diğer iskeletler kadar işe yaramaz olacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana biraz zaman verin.Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.22,0:05:41.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu işi bitirir bitirmez, size döneceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.03,0:05:57.11,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası, kuşların insanlara hükmettiği Güney Mavi'deki Torino Krallığı.Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.09,0:06:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En kısa sürede bu adadan gitmek istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.86,0:06:15.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası berbat.Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.73,0:06:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuşlar bana oyuncak gibi davranıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.56,0:06:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanlar beni pişirip yemek istiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.17,0:06:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üstelik...Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.94,0:06:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...insanlar ve kuşlar...Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.54,0:06:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sürekli birbiriyle savaşıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacağım?Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.16,0:06:59.44,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası Grand Line'daki  Momoiro Adası'nda bulunan Kamabakka Krallığı.Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası da ne?Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.24,0:07:06.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha önemlisi...Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunların nesi var?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.83,0:07:27.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin.Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.10,0:07:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni bekliyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de kimsin?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.36,0:07:55.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sevgili Nami-san, Robin-chan...Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.03,0:08:01.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi görmek için sabırsızlanıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.77,0:08:07.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Görüştüğümüzde çok iyi arkadaş olacağımızdan eminim.Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.56,0:08:33.00,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası, hava durumunu inceleyen bilim insanlarına ev sahipliği yapan, küçük gökyüzü adası, Weatheria.Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.94,0:08:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Genç bayan!Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.24,0:08:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya!Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.44,0:08:50.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl gemi bu böyle? Uçuyor mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.32,0:08:57.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.12,0:09:01.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte gidiyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.86,0:09:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.97,0:09:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşimize yarayacak bir ada var!Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.94,0:09:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ada...Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.68,0:09:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu adanın sorunlarını mı çözeceksin?Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.15,0:09:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.49,0:09:35.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hava araştırmamı kullanarak buraya yağmur yağdırabilirim!Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.29,0:09:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.00,0:09:41.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hizmetlerim şu anda özel indirimde.Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.97,0:09:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,100 milyon beliye ne dersiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.53,0:09:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,100 milyon mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.74,0:09:51.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz fazla mı pahalı oldu acaba?Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.41,0:09:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok pahalı! Ödeyebilmeleri mümkün değil!Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.91,0:09:58.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle mi?Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.68,0:10:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman 100 beli olur.Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.02,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.49,0:10:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Çok ucuz! – Çok ucuz!Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.03,0:10:12.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunlar...Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sabun baloncukları mı?Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.57,0:10:18.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçlerinde bir şey var.Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.24,0:10:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Genç bayan. Bunu kullan ve rüzgâr çağır.Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.88,0:10:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu...Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.98,0:10:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam güçte mi olsun?Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.71,0:10:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.94,0:11:03.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gözlerime inanamıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.17,0:11:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yağmur yağıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük başarı!Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.99,0:11:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi mutlular.Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.79,0:11:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle.Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.82,0:11:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hava bilimim epey kullanışlı, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.57,0:12:07.08,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi Karakuri Adası'na gidiyoruz. Dahilerin doğduğu krallık, Baldimore.Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.78,0:12:14.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu hastaneye taşımalıyız, Kitton.Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.58,0:12:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.81,0:12:40.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek o bir sayborg?Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koladan güç alıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.45,0:12:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacağız?Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.75,0:12:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu anda hiç kolamız yok!Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.98,0:12:50.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele etmeliyiz! Başlayalım!Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.65,0:12:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam.Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.64,0:13:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bayım!Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.78,0:13:20.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, sen demin tanıştığım genç adam olmalısın.Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beklettiğim için çok üzgünüm.Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.49,0:13:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Biraz değişmemiş misin?Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.73,0:13:32.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle. Görünüşe bakılırsa ne yazık ki şu anda hiç kolaları yok.Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.83,0:13:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden beni çay kullanarak şarj etmiş gibiler.Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.07,0:13:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Darjeeling çayı.Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.07,0:13:36.63,Note,,0,0,0,,Hindistan'ın Darjeeling bölgesinde yetişen siyah çay.Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.97,0:13:37.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çay mı?Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.47,0:13:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Süper bir lezzeti var.Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Süper sakinleştirici.Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.19,0:13:56.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bayım!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.65,0:13:59.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ne kadar düşüncesizim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.16,0:14:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buyrun. Sıcak, dikkatli olun.Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.74,0:14:16.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, kastettiğim bu değil!Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.61,0:14:20.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bayım! Demin çok daha eğlenceliydin!Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.88,0:14:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle mi?Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.70,0:14:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok soğuk.Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dışarıda ne yapıyorum?Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muhteşem, bir atkı!Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.65,0:14:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.22,0:15:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ne demek oluyor?Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.40,0:15:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"UZAK DURUN"Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.23,0:15:19.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Burası sürgün yemiş Makine Hayvanlar'ın ormanı."Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.73,0:15:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Ormanda Sürpriz Uyanış Planı"!Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.34,0:15:59.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu zorlu çevrede hayatta kalmaya çalışarak vahşi doğanı geri kazan, bayım!Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.01,0:16:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, sakin olsanız iyi olur!Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.85,0:16:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Epey gergin görünüyorsunuz.Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.75,0:16:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi kahvaltı zamanı değil, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.72,0:16:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru zamanda yemelisiniz, yoksa sağlığınızı etkiler.Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.42,0:16:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, anlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.89,0:16:17.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek şimdi gerçekten kahvaltı vakti, öyle mi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.86,0:16:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne düşünüyordum ki?Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leeeziz!Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.07,0:16:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabahları ilk iş olarak  bir fincan çay içmek gibisi yok.Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.31,0:16:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta olmak güzel.Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.85,0:16:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görünüşe göre işe yaramadı.Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İmdat!Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şiddet kesinlikle-Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.29,0:17:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haylazlık yapacak yaşta olabilirsin, ama-Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.29,0:17:25.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu konuşursak-Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.10,0:17:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eminim-Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir sonuca-Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.73,0:17:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Varabiliriz.Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.10,0:17:36.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes şunu. Şiddet... hiçbir şeyi... çözmez.Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.81,0:17:38.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frank bey!Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.61,0:17:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi ama! Ona bunu anlatamazsın!Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.64,0:17:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakin ol-Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.55,0:17:44.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Söyleyeceklerimi dinle-Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.05,0:17:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinle-Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.88,0:17:47.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinle-Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.65,0:17:49.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Din-Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.35,0:17:51.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Di-Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.76,0:17:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Le–Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.46,0:17:55.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Din–Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.73,0:17:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Din–Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.89,0:17:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Din–Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.90,0:18:02.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Din-Le-Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.51,0:18:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,SÜPER!!!Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim kim olduğumu sanıyorsunuz?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.49,0:18:33.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben büyük Franky-sama'yım!Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.36,0:18:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaşasın!Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.00,0:18:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bayım, normale döndün!Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.10,0:18:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hen-tai!Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.10,0:18:39.77,Note,,0,0,0,,"Hentai" hem "sapık kişi" hem de "dönüşen kişi" anlamına gelebilir. Burda eski halime "döndüm" anlamında kullanılıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.84,0:18:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.17,0:18:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz sakinleşince bütün buhar kayboldu.Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.88,0:18:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Bu sapıkça...  Yani korkunç!Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.88,0:18:51.01,Note,,0,0,0,,Hentai: Sapık, Taihen: KorkunçDialogue: 50,0:18:51.01,0:18:53.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey... Şey...Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.35,0:18:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, biliyorum! Bir yer var!Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.43,0:19:10.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyükbabam burada bir sürü tehlikeli yaratıklar olduğunu ve asla gelmemem gerektiğini söyledi.Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.72,0:19:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte yemeğin.Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.42,0:19:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bitirince seni yeniden sorgulayacağız.Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.46,0:19:36.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dört gözle bekliyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.90,0:19:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni epey hırpalamış gibiler, genç bayan.Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.67,0:19:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen kimsin?Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.64,0:19:50.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece yaşlı bir adam.Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.91,0:19:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya bugün getirildim.Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.89,0:19:57.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama yaşlı insanlar işlerine yaramadığı için,  buraya hapsedip bıraktılar.Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.25,0:20:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu duyduğuma üzüldüm.Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.25,0:20:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.52,0:20:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İsyancılar özel bölgede sorun çıkarıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.29,0:20:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Müdürün emri.  Herkes gidip onları yakalasın!Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.56,0:20:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Emredersiniz! – Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.00,0:20:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İsyancılar mı?Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.34,0:20:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet. Emrettiğiniz gibi,...Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.47,0:20:27.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sorun daha da büyümeden tüm birlikler onları bastırmaya gitti.Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.21,0:20:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O emri hiç vermedim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.72,0:20:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özel Hapis Kulesi'ndeki birlikleri de sevketmediniz, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.33,0:20:46.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben Devrim Ordusu'nun bir ajanıyım.Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.33,0:20:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahmaklar!Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.66,0:20:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birkaç önemsiz isyancı kimin umrunda?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.03,0:20:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin'in kaçmasına izin vermeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.74,0:20:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi iş.Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.87,0:20:59.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize önderlik ederseniz, bu savaşı kazanabiliriz.Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.74,0:21:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana bırakabilirsin.Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.15,0:21:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazır gelmişken, oradaki genç bayanı da serbest bırak.Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.29,0:21:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vurun onu!Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.86,0:21:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clutch!Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.86,0:21:19.83,Attack,,0,0,0,,KavrayışDialogue: 50,0:21:29.74,0:21:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin mi dedi?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.99,0:21:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası da ne böyle?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.86,0:21:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güzel kokuyor.Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.86,0:21:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, kesinlikle bunu yiyebilirim!Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.86,0:21:54.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen şelalesi.Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.43,0:21:56.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spagetti otları.Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.40,0:21:58.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jambon meyveleri.Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.17,0:22:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tatlı olarak da çikolata kayaları.Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.84,0:22:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada gördüğün her şey yenilebilir!Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.41,0:22:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yenilebilir olduğuna emin misin?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.08,0:22:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yenilebilir.Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.98,0:22:12.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nefis!Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.05,0:22:18.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eğer çok yer ve dayanıklılığını artırırsan, insan yiyen bitkiler sana saldırmaya cüret edemez!Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.52,0:22:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten mi? Bu harika!Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.39,0:22:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama bunlar çok leziz. Yiyebildiğim kadar yiyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.39,0:22:25.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sırf yemekle olmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.46,0:22:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Antrenman yapana dek anlamı yok!Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.06,0:22:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.50,0:22:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sürekli yemeye devam edersem,...Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.53,0:22:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...senin gibi ormanın havalı kahramanı olabileceğim, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.58,0:22:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla yiyemem.Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.25,0:22:45.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp'n...Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.15,0:22:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu adada, şişman şeyler hemen yenilir.Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.55,0:22:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yenilecek miyim?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.79,0:22:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçılması mümkün olmayan  Boin Takımadaları'ndayız!Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.49,0:22:57.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçılması mümkün değil mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.86,0:23:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve ben ormanın kahramanı,...Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.00,0:23:01.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera–Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:45.59,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | kazaskerDialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:59.80,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | kazaskerDialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:04.52,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | kazaskerDialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Shikkearu Krallığı'nın Harabeleri Kuraigana AdasıDialogue: 1,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Shikkearu Krallığı'nın Harabeleri Kuraigana AdasıDialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:20.48,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Sefalet Ülkesi, Harahetternia Namakura AdasıDialogue: 1,0:03:15.65,0:03:20.48,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Sefalet Ülkesi, Harahetternia Namakura AdasıDialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:57.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Torino Krallığı Güney MaviDialogue: 1,0:05:53.10,0:05:57.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Torino Krallığı Güney MaviDialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:59.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kamabakka Krallığı Momoiro Adası, Grand LineDialogue: 1,0:06:55.67,0:06:59.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kamabakka Krallığı Momoiro Adası, Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:38.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,WeatheriaDialogue: 1,0:08:35.93,0:08:38.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,WeatheriaDialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:09.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,"Geleceğin Ülkesi" Baldimore Karakuri AdasıDialogue: 1,0:12:05.84,0:12:09.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,"Geleceğin Ülkesi" Baldimore Karakuri AdasıDialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.17,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,....Ameliyat SürüyorDialogue: 1,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.17,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,....Ameliyat SürüyorDialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.09,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,....Ameliyat SürüyorDialogue: 1,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.09,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,....Ameliyat SürüyorDialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:29.45,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Tequila Wolf Doğu MaviDialogue: 1,0:19:23.45,0:19:29.45,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Tequila Wolf Doğu MaviDialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:43.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Boin Takımadaları Grand LineDialogue: 1,0:21:40.48,0:21:43.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Boin Takımadaları Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:03.35,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:03.35,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Fedew Feeso Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:21.57,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:21.57,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GabDialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:26.41,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TypesettingDialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:26.41,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GabDialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:32.45,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:32.45,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack PhosCity Scolines ZenefDialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:38.76,Cre